    "description": "Today nothing enforces Effective_From\\__c < Effective_To_\\_c, and nothing prevents overlapping periods on the same rep + deal — which makes period-based attribution unreliable.\n\n* From < To validation\n\n* No-overlap check across that rep + deal's assignment history\n\n* Migration bypass as per BUILD-98\n\n* DECIDE ALONGSIDE D12 (Date vs Date/Time — see BUILD-47): timezone rounding on Date/Time values can create false overlaps and spurious record updates, which then trigger history records and, once Direction 1 is live, potentially outbound syncs\n\nEffort: \\~3h.\n\nSource: Asana Reconciliation v2, 2026-07-29, §5; CMS Integration Design v1 §5.4.",
